{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T06:42:44+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-22T06:42:44+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Kering SA","sector":"Consumer Cyclical","industry":"Luxury Goods","country":"France","city":"Paris","website":"https://www.kering.com","employees":41147,"summary":"Kering SA manages the development of a collection of renowned houses in fashion, leather goods, and jewelry in the Asia Pacific, Western Europe, North America, Japan, and internationally. The company provides ready-to-wear products, accessories, and beauty products for men and women. It also offers leather goods and shoes; watches and jewelry; eyewear products; and fragrances and cosmetics. The company provides its products under the Gucci, Saint Laurent, Bottega Veneta, Balenciaga, Alexander McQueen, Brioni, Boucheron, Pomellato, DoDo, Qeelin, and Ginori 1735, as well as Kering Eyewear and Kering Beauté brands. Kering SA was formerly known as PPR SA. and changed its name to Kering SA in May 2013. The company was founded in 1963 and is based in Paris, France.","exchange":"Paris","currency":"EUR","financial_currency":"EUR","summary_fr":"Kering SA gère le développement d'une collection de maisons renommées dans la mode, la maroquinerie et la joaillerie en Asie-Pacifique, en Europe occidentale, en Amérique du Nord, au Japon et à l'international. La société fournit des produits de prêt-à-porter, des accessoires et des produits de beauté pour hommes et femmes. Elle propose également des articles en cuir et des chaussures, des montres et des bijoux, des produits de lunetterie, des parfums et des cosmétiques."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":26516164608,"shares_outstanding":122618101,"trailing_pe":null,"forward_pe":22.506186,"price_to_book":1.8309823,"ev_to_ebitda":14.63,"ev_to_revenue":2.547,"dividend_yield":0.0139,"payout_ratio":1.2766,"beta_yahoo":1.003},"targets":{"current_price":216